nents/date-picker#best-practices","content":"For typed/keyboard-fast date entry far from today, use the calendar's month dropdown and year input."},"279":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-37","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#troubleshooting","content":"Dates not localizing? Wrap the app in `<I18nProvider locale=\"…\">`."},"280":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-38","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#troubleshooting","content":"Form value missing on submit? Pass a `name` — React Aria renders the hidden input."},"281":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-39","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#props","content":"The `DatePicker` component accepts the following props:"},"282":{"id":"/docs/components/date-picker-40","page_id":"/docs/components/date-picker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/date-picker#props","content":"The `DateRangePicker` component accepts the following props:"},"283":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"page","content":"DropZone","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone"},"284":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone","content":"A standalone region that accepts drag-and-drop file interactions, rendering a clearly defined target area where users can drop files."},"285":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#installation","content":"Installation"},"286":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-2","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#examples","content":"Examples"},"287":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-3","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#default","content":"Default"},"288":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-4","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#disabled","content":"Disabled"},"289":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-5","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#file-upload","content":"File Upload"},"290":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-6","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#drop-target-label","content":"Drop Target Label"},"291":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-7","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#replace-existing-file","content":"Replace Existing File"},"292":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-8","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"293":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-9","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"294":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-10","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"Screen readers"},"295":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-11","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"296":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-12","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#props","content":"Props"},"297":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-13","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#default","content":"A minimal drop zone. The \\`onDrop\\` callback receives the dropped items; use the exported \\`isFileDropItem\\` guard to narrow them to files. Wrap the instructional text in \\`\\<Text slot=\"label\">\\` so it labels the visually hidden drop button for screen readers."},"298":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-14","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#disabled","content":"Set \\`isDisabled\\` to prevent the drop zone from accepting interactions. The zone is dimmed and the cursor indicates it is not interactive."},"299":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-15","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#file-upload","content":"A reference composition combining \\`DropZone\\` with \\`FileTrigger\\` to support both click-to-browse and drag-and-drop. Use this as a starting point and adapt the accepted formats, size limit, and handlers to your product's requirements."},"300":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-16","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#drop-target-label","content":"Pass a render-prop function as \\`children\\` to change the zone's content while a valid drag is active. Branching on \\`isDropTarget\\` requires no extra state. Pair it with \\`getDropOperation\\` to reject unsupported types - the label only appears when the drag is accepted."},"301":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-17","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#replace-existing-file","content":"Use \\`children\\` as a render function to show different content based on the current zone state - here, swapping the default label for \"Drop to replace\" when a file is already selected and a new drag is active. The same \\`onDrop\\` handler services both the drag path and the \\`FileTrigger\\` click path, so either gesture replaces the selection."},"302":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-18","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Key"},"303":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Description"},"304":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"`Tab`"},"305":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Moves focus to the drop zone"},"306":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-22","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"`Enter` / `Space`"},"307":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-23","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#keyboard","content":"Opens the file picker so files can be selected without a pointer"},"308":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-24","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"The drop zone renders a visually hidden `<button>` inside the container. Assistive technology discovers and announces this button as an interactive element — activating it opens the native file picker without a pointer."},"309":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-25","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"The button's accessible name is built from two sources, combined in order:"},"310":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-26","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"**`<Text slot=\"label\">`** — any `Text` child with `slot=\"label\"` has its `id` linked to the button via `aria-labelledby`. This is the recommended way to provide a contextual label that is also visible to sighted users."},"311":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-27","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#screen-readers","content":"**`aria-label`** — pass `aria-label` on the `DropZone` component to override or supplement the label (e.g. `aria-label=\"Upload profile photo\"`). When no `Text slot=\"label\"` is present and no `aria-label` is set, the button falls back to the default \"DropZone\" label provided by React Aria."},"312":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-28","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Use the drop zone alongside a button-based file picker — drag-and-drop is a convenience, never the only way to upload."},"313":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-29","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Replace the default text with `children` to communicate the accepted file types and size limits up front."},"314":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-30","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Let the drop zone fill its container; constrain it with the surrounding layout rather than setting a fixed width on the component itself."},"315":{"id":"/docs/components/drop-zone-31","page_id":"/docs/components/drop-zone","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drop-zone#best-practices","content":"Reflect upload state (validating, uploading, error) outside the drop zone so the target area stays clear and predictable."},"316":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"page","content":"Drawer","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer"},"317":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-0","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"An overlay panel that slides in from a screen edge, supporting sidebar navigation and bottom sheets."},"318":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-1","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#installation","content":"Installation"},"319":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-2","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#examples","content":"Examples"},"320":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-3","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#default","content":"Default"},"321":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-4","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#bottom-sheet","content":"Bottom Sheet"},"322":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-5","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#placements","content":"Placements"},"323":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-6","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#nested-popover","content":"Nested Popover"},"324":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-7","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#no-escape-dismiss","content":"No Escape Dismiss"},"325":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-8","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#scrollable-content","content":"Scrollable content"},"326":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-9","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"327":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-10","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Keyboard"},"328":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-11","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"ARIA"},"329":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-12","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"330":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-13","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/drawer#props","content":"Props"},"331":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-14","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"An overlay panel that slides in from a screen edge. Built on the same RAC stack as `Modal` (a\nmodal overlay with an `elevation=\"overlay\"` panel and CSS transitions), it supports sidebar\nnavigation and bottom sheets."},"332":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-15","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer","content":"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."},"333":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-16","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#default","content":"Use \\`\\<DrawerTrigger>\\` to wrap a trigger button and a \\`\\<Drawer>\\`. The drawer opens when the trigger is pressed."},"334":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-17","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#bottom-sheet","content":"Use \\`placement=\"bottom\"\\` with controlled state for a bottom sheet pattern. Compose a\n\\`CloseButton\\` for the dismiss affordance."},"335":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-18","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#placements","content":"The drawer slides in from whichever edge you set with \\`placement\\`."},"336":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-19","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#nested-popover","content":"Popovers rendered inside a drawer stay open without dismissing the drawer."},"337":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-20","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#no-escape-dismiss","content":"Use \\`isKeyboardDismissDisabled\\` to prevent the drawer from being dismissed by the escape key."},"338":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-21","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#scrollable-content","content":"When the content is taller than the drawer, the \\`Content\\` region scrolls while the title row\nstays pinned."},"339":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-22","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Key"},"340":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-23","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Action"},"341":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-24","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Escape`"},"342":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-25","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Close the drawer (unless `isKeyboardDismissDisabled`)"},"343":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-26","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"`Tab`"},"344":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-27","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#keyboard","content":"Move focus within the drawer (focus is trapped)"},"345":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-28","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"`role=\"dialog\"` with `aria-modal=\"true\"` on the drawer panel (via RAC Modal)"},"346":{"id":"/docs/components/drawer-29","page_id":"/docs/components/drawer","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/drawer#aria","content":"A `Heading slot=\"title\"` 